        "text_VdhF7Y": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>These pieces are made from repurposed graffiti, fragments of iconic landmarks, fan-favorite sports collaborations, and other one-of-a-kind sources, all designed to be worn solo or stacked together.</strong> While our unique bracelets for women have become some of our most-loved styles, every piece is made to be worn by anyone who connects with the story in front of them.  Browse the rest of our <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/products\" title=\"browse all jewelry\">unique jewelry collection</a> for more reclaimed pieces with the same craft behind them.</p><p><strong>Rebel Nell was founded in Detroit in 2013 to bring real purpose to every piece we make. </strong>Our Creative Designers, women employed through our workforce program, are the hands behind every bracelet, so each one you wear carries both a piece of reclaimed art and a story of opportunity along with it. You can read more about <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-story\" title=\"read our story\">Rebel Nell's story</a> and read <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/reviews-1\" title=\"read customer reviews\">our customer reviews</a>.</p>"
